NOTE ON SCOPE

This licence covers the code, documentation and analysis written by
Pranit Ajay Chaudhari. It does NOT cover the two datasets in data/raw/, which
are the work of other people and carry their own terms:

  * Brazilian E-Commerce Public Dataset by Olist - CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, published
    by Olist Store. Note the NonCommercial and ShareAlike conditions.
  * Marketing Campaign / Customer Personality dataset - a public dataset whose
    publisher is not named in the file.

See data/raw/README.md for sources, licences and file checksums.
